      "description": "Press a remote-control key on the Shield, e.g. DPAD_DOWN with repeat=3 to move down three rows.\n\n<use_case>\nNavigate Android TV interfaces, menus, and controls using directional pad, enter, back, and home.\n</use_case>\n\n<important_notes>\n- Only sends allowed key enum values; power toggles and raw text typing are not supported.\n- VOLUME_UP is capped at 20 presses in any 5 minutes; to set a level, use the receiver's or TV's volume tool.\n</important_notes>\n",
      "inputSchema": {
        "properties": {
